    <li class="project-row">
      <span class="project-row__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      <div class="project-row__identity">
        <p class="project-row__kind">Strategy and learning</p>
        <h2>Decision tools and program learning</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="project-row__description"><a href="https://www.cartercenter.org/resources/pdfs/news/health_publications/hispaniola/2022-carter-center-hispaniola-initiative-proceedings-summary.pdf#page=24" rel="noreferrer">Decision tools</a> and <a href="https://campaigneffectiveness.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Collaborative-Action-Strategy-for-HCE-December2023.pdf#page=19" rel="noreferrer">evaluation frameworks</a> for setting priorities, assessing service quality and <a href="https://journals.plos.org/plosntds/article?id=10.1371/journal.pntd.0008318" rel="noreferrer">learning from campaign delivery</a>.</p>
