      </div>
      <p class="project-row__description">A model that connects geospatial planning, real-time field communication and community engagement so teams can adapt campaigns as they run. Work with <a href="https://www.cartercenter.org/country/haiti/" rel="noreferrer">The Carter Center</a> and <a href="https://www.mspp.gouv.ht/presentation-du-ministere" rel="noreferrer">Haiti’s health ministry</a>, as part of Emory’s HELP team. Platforms: <a href="https://www.crosscut.io/" rel="noreferrer">Crosscut</a> and <a href="https://www.balcony.io/" rel="noreferrer">Balcony</a>.</p>
    </li>

