      </div>
      <p class="project-row__description"><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.eudecido.app&amp;hl=en_US" rel="noreferrer">EU DECIDO</a> provides safety-planning and support resources for women experiencing abuse in Brazil. <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.healthlink.women&amp;hl=en_US" rel="noreferrer">WoW: World of Women</a> provides multilingual, doctor-verified health education for women and families.</p>
